prompt.recommended_prompt_verbatim:
Edit this exact photograph. Do not crop, zoom, rotate, reframe or change the aspect ratio: the output must line up pixel for pixel with the input, at 1376 × 768, with the camera unchanged.

Change only the house walls, windows, doors, fascia, soffits and gutters, including the single-storey extension. Make it a dramatic, high-end contemporary renovation:
- smooth external-insulation render in warm chalk white, with a crisp dark-grey plinth band at ground level;
- slim anthracite aluminium windows set in deep, clean reveals, in exactly the same openings;
- the rear sliding doors become minimal, floor-to-ceiling, slim-framed anthracite glazing in exactly the same opening;
- the single-storey extension clad in vertical charred-timber boards, with its door and window kept in exactly the same positions;
- slim anthracite fascia, soffits and gutters, with the eaves line in exactly the same place.

No quoins, no stone, no decorative mouldings.

Keep everything else exactly as it is: the house shape, roof tiles, chimney, roof window, patio, table, chairs, umbrella, pots, plants, barbecue, lawn, garden, fences, hedges, neighbouring houses, street, sky, evening light and shadows. No people, no text, no logos.
